{"_id":"68a736198ec3d8323af16d0f","nodeId":"KWT-Lu-HCeA3GdZawD0a7","roadmapSlug":"flutter","createdAt":"2025-08-21T15:07:05.349Z","description":"# Riverpod\n\nRiverpod was created by the same author as Provider, and is designed to make it easier to manage application state by providing a more intuitive API and better performance than Provider.\n\nOne of the key features of Riverpod is its ability to manage and scope state in a more granular way than Provider. This can make it easier to reason about your application's state and can lead to more efficient re-renders.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"riverpod","url":"https://pub.dev/packages/riverpod","_id":"6a7f4f79cb44947debd1af95"},{"type":"official","title":"Riverpod in Flutter","url":"https://docs.flutter.dev/development/data-and-backend/state-mgmt/options#riverpod","_id":"6a7f4f79cb44947debd1af96"},{"type":"official","title":"riverpod Documentation","url":"https://riverpod.dev/","_id":"6a7f4f79cb44947debd1af97"},{"type":"article","title":"Documentation v2 is in progress","url":"https://docs-v2.riverpod.dev/","_id":"6a7f4f79cb44947debd1af98"},{"type":"article","title":"Flutter Riverpod 2.0: The Ultimate Guide","url":"https://codewithandrea.com/articles/flutter-state-management-riverpod/","_id":"6a7f4f79cb44947debd1af99"}],"updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:25:13.672Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/flutter/content/KWT-Lu-HCeA3GdZawD0a7.md"}